# Use som-utils Scripts for OpenFlow Entity Operations

When performing common OpenFlow entity operations (clone, cleanup, force-drop, state changes), ALWAYS use the scripts in:

`/Users/aethier/playground/the_source/snowflake/openflow-utils/som-utils/`

## Available scripts

| Script | Use when |
|--------|----------|
| `clone_connector.sh` | Cloning/duplicating a connector (copies config) |
| `cleanup_connectors.sh` | Bulk cleanup of connectors |
| `cleanup_runtimes.sh` | Bulk cleanup of runtimes |
| `force_drop_entity.sh` | Force-dropping a stuck entity |
| `set_entity_state.sh` | Force-setting entity state |
| `clear_entity_tasks.sh` | Clearing entity tasks |
| `get_entity_tasks.sh` | Viewing entity tasks |

## Rules

- NEVER manually replicate what these scripts do (e.g. never manually CREATE + GET config + PUT config to clone a connector)
- Run the script with `-h` if you need to check usage
- All scripts accept `-c <connection>` for the snow CLI connection name
